  "goodToKnow": "Die Beendigung is the act of ending something, and it's common in contracts and administration: die Beendigung des Arbeitsverhältnisses (termination of employment). It derives from beenden, which is transitive: Er beendet das Gespräch. By contrast, enden is intransitive, as in Das Gespräch endet. In everyday speech, people say Ende (Am Ende des Films) and not Beendigung."
